*~
s3cfg
\#*\#
#
# intermediate / generated fiiles
#
*.incl
*.errlog
*.stylelog
output.rtc
.claude/settings.local.json
# unit1 stays unprefixed; unit2+ dirs use a uN prefix (u2lessons-pdfs/,
# u2lessons-media/, etc.) and will need their own lines here as they're added
**/lessons-pdfs/*.pdf
dist/
dist/*
__pycache__/
__pycache__/*
build/
build/*
# images generated from lessons-gp scripts so ignore them (lessons-media is
# unit1's real output dir; images is a local symlink alias to it, see below)
**/lessons-media/*.png
# local rendering convenience symlink, recreated per work session
# (points at whichever unit's real *lessons-media dir you're working on),
# never committed
/images

